/basechests <p>Syntax: <code>/basechests &lt;base_id&gt;</code> Description: Inspect container storage contents and locks inside a base camp. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;base_id&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/basechests &lt;base_id&gt;
</code></pre></p> /baseinfo <p>Syntax: <code>/baseinfo [base_id]</code> Description: Show base camps or inspect workers (HP, SAN, sickness) and chests for a specific base. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[base_id]</code> Example: <pre><code>/baseinfo [base_id]
</code></pre></p> /baserelocate <p>Syntax: <code>/baserelocate &lt;base_id&gt;</code> Description: Relocate a base camp and Palbox to the caller's current coordinates. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;base_id&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/baserelocate &lt;base_id&gt;
</code></pre></p> /basewipe <p>Syntax: <code>/basewipe &lt;base_id&gt;</code> Description: Cleanly wipe all structures and chests in a base camp with zero item drops. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;base_id&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/basewipe &lt;base_id&gt;
</code></pre></p> /destroyguild <p>Syntax: <code>/destroyguild &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt;</code> Description: Alias for /guilddisband. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/destroyguild &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt;
</code></pre></p> /guild <p>Syntax: <code>/guild &lt;action&gt; [args...]</code> Description: Unified guild management: list, info, promote, demote, kick, add, transfer, disband, destroy, blacklist. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;action&gt; [args...]</code> Example: <pre><code>/guild &lt;action&gt; [args...]
</code></pre></p> /guildadd <p>Syntax: <code>/guildadd &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;player&gt;</code> Description: Add a player directly into a guild (auto-queues if offline). Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;player&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/guildadd &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;player&gt;
</code></pre></p> /guildaudit <p>Syntax: <code>/guildaudit &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; [limit]</code> Description: View recent item deposits, withdrawals, and quick-stacks in guild chests. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; [limit]</code> Example: <pre><code>/guildaudit &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; [limit]
</code></pre></p> /guildblacklist <p>Syntax: <code>/guildblacklist &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;add|remove|list&gt; [player] [reason]</code> Description: Manage blacklisted players for a guild. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;add|remove|list&gt; [player] [reason]</code> Example: <pre><code>/guildblacklist &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;add|remove|list&gt; [player] [reason]
</code></pre></p> /guilddemote <p>Syntax: <code>/guilddemote &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;player&gt; [member|guest]</code> Description: Demote a guild member to regular Member or Guest. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;player&gt; [member|guest]</code> Example: <pre><code>/guilddemote &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;player&gt; [member|guest]
</code></pre></p> /guilddestroy <p>Syntax: <code>/guilddestroy &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt;</code> Description: Alias for /guilddisband. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/guilddestroy &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt;
</code></pre></p> /guilddisband <p>Syntax: <code>/guilddisband &lt;guild_id&gt;</code> Description: Permanently disband and dispose a guild. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;guild_id&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/guilddisband &lt;guild_id&gt;
</code></pre></p> /guildinfo <p>Syntax: <code>/guildinfo &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt;</code> Description: Inspect a guild: master, member roster, base camp IDs, raid status. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/guildinfo &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt;
</code></pre></p> /guildkick <p>Syntax: <code>/guildkick &lt;guild_id&gt; &lt;player_uid|player_name&gt;</code> Description: Kick a member from a guild. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;guild_id&gt; &lt;player_uid|player_name&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/guildkick &lt;guild_id&gt; &lt;player_uid|player_name&gt;
</code></pre></p> /guildlist <p>Syntax: <code>/guildlist</code> Description: List all active guilds, levels, member counts, and base counts. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Example: <pre><code>/guildlist
</code></pre></p> /guildpending <p>Syntax: <code>/guildpending [guild_id|guild_name]</code> Description: List pending offline guild joins waiting for player login. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[guild_id|guild_name]</code> Example: <pre><code>/guildpending [guild_id|guild_name]
</code></pre></p> /guildpromote <p>Syntax: <code>/guildpromote &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;player&gt; [submaster|master]</code> Description: Promote a guild member to SubMaster (Officer) or GuildMaster. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;player&gt; [submaster|master]</code> Example: <pre><code>/guildpromote &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;player&gt; [submaster|master]
</code></pre></p> /guildremove <p>Syntax: <code>/guildremove &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;player&gt;</code> Description: Remove a member from a guild. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;player&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/guildremove &lt;guild_id|guild_name&gt; &lt;player&gt;
</code></pre></p> /guildtransfer <p>Syntax: <code>/guildtransfer [guild] &lt;player&gt;</code> Description: Transfer guild leadership to a player. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[guild] &lt;player&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/guildtransfer [guild] &lt;player&gt;
</code></pre></p> /setguildleader <p>Syntax: <code>/setguildleader [guild] &lt;player&gt;</code> Description: Alias for /guildtransfer. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[guild] &lt;player&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/setguildleader [guild] &lt;player&gt;
</code></pre></p> /transfer_master <p>Syntax: <code>/transfer_master [guild] &lt;player&gt;</code> Description: Alias for /guildtransfer. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[guild] &lt;player&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/transfer_master [guild] &lt;player&gt;
</code></pre></p>

/admins <p>Syntax: <code>/admins</code> Description: List online admins. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Example: <pre><code>/admins
</code></pre></p> /alert <p>Syntax: <code>/alert &lt;player|*&gt; &lt;message&gt;</code> Description: Show an on-screen game alert to a player or all (). Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;player|*&gt; &lt;message&gt;</code> Example:* <pre><code>/alert &lt;player|*&gt; &lt;message&gt;
</code></pre></p> /alertall <p>Syntax: <code>/alertall &lt;message&gt;</code> Description: Show an on-screen game alert to every player. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;message&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/alertall &lt;message&gt;
</code></pre></p> /broadcast <p>Syntax: <code>/broadcast &lt;message&gt;</code> Description: Send a server-wide chat message. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;message&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/broadcast &lt;message&gt;
</code></pre></p> /dialog <p>Syntax: <code>/dialog [player|all] &lt;message&gt;</code> Description: Alias for /popup. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player|all] &lt;message&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/dialog [player|all] &lt;message&gt;
</code></pre></p> /givei <p>Syntax: <code>/givei &lt;player&gt; &lt;itemid&gt; [amount]</code> Description: Alias for /giveitem. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;player&gt; &lt;itemid&gt; [amount]</code> Example: <pre><code>/givei &lt;player&gt; &lt;itemid&gt; [amount]
</code></pre></p> /given <p>Syntax: <code>/given [player] &lt;NpcID&gt; [level]</code> Description: Alias for /givenpc. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player] &lt;NpcID&gt; [level]</code> Example: <pre><code>/given [player] &lt;NpcID&gt; [level]
</code></pre></p> /givep <p>Syntax: <code>/givep [player] &lt;PalID&gt; [level] [rank]</code> Description: Alias for /givepal. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player] &lt;PalID&gt; [level] [rank]</code> Example: <pre><code>/givep [player] &lt;PalID&gt; [level] [rank]
</code></pre></p> /help <p>Syntax: <code>/help [command]</code> Description: List commands or show help for a specific command. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>All Players</code> Arguments: <code>[command]</code> Example: <pre><code>/help [command]
</code></pre></p> /info <p>Syntax: <code>/info &lt;player&gt;</code> Description: Show full profile: position, ping, session, violations, flags. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;player&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/info &lt;player&gt;
</code></pre></p> /notice <p>Syntax: <code>/notice &lt;message&gt;</code> Description: Broadcast a full-screen native server notice to all players. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;message&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/notice &lt;message&gt;
</code></pre></p> /playerinfo <p>Syntax: <code>/playerinfo &lt;player|uid&gt;</code> Description: Inspect an online or offline player: stats, guild, last position, tech, save info. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;player|uid&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/playerinfo &lt;player|uid&gt;
</code></pre></p> /players <p>Syntax: <code>/players</code> Description: List all online players with status. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Example: <pre><code>/players
</code></pre></p> /popup <p>Syntax: <code>/popup [player|all] &lt;message&gt;</code> Description: Show a centered native modal popup dialog with [ OK ] button. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player|all] &lt;message&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/popup [player|all] &lt;message&gt;
</code></pre></p> /popupall <p>Syntax: <code>/popupall &lt;message&gt;</code> Description: Broadcast a centered native modal popup dialog to all players. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;message&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/popupall &lt;message&gt;
</code></pre></p> /reloadcfg <p>Syntax: <code>/reloadcfg</code> Description: Hot-reload config.json without restarting. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Example: <pre><code>/reloadcfg
</code></pre></p> /save <p>Syntax: <code>/save</code> Description: Force an immediate world save. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Example: <pre><code>/save
</code></pre></p> /setadmin <p>Syntax: <code>/setadmin &lt;player&gt; &lt;true|false&gt;</code> Description: Grant or revoke temporary admin privileges for a player. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;player&gt; &lt;true|false&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/setadmin &lt;player&gt; &lt;true|false&gt;
</code></pre></p> /spawnp <p>Syntax: <code>/spawnp [player] &lt;PalID&gt; [level]</code> Description: Spawn a wild Pal in the world next to a player. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player] &lt;PalID&gt; [level]</code> Example: <pre><code>/spawnp [player] &lt;PalID&gt; [level]
</code></pre></p> /spawnw <p>Syntax: <code>/spawnw &lt;PalID&gt; &lt;level&gt; &lt;x&gt; &lt;y&gt; &lt;z&gt;</code> Description: Spawn a wild Pal in the world at specific coordinates. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;PalID&gt; &lt;level&gt; &lt;x&gt; &lt;y&gt; &lt;z&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/spawnw &lt;PalID&gt; &lt;level&gt; &lt;x&gt; &lt;y&gt; &lt;z&gt;
</code></pre></p> /time <p>Syntax: <code>/time &lt;0-23&gt;</code> Description: Set the world time to a specific hour. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;0-23&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/time &lt;0-23&gt;
</code></pre></p> /uptime <p>Syntax: <code>/uptime</code> Description: Show server uptime, player count, and violation stats. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Example: <pre><code>/uptime
</code></pre></p> /worldtime <p>Syntax: <code>/worldtime &lt;hour 0-23&gt;</code> Description: Set the in-game world clock hour (server-wide). Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;hour 0-23&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/worldtime &lt;hour 0-23&gt;
</code></pre></p> /worldtimescale <p>Syntax: <code>/worldtimescale &lt;rate&gt;</code> Description: Set the world time progression rate (server-wide). Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;rate&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/worldtimescale &lt;rate&gt;
</code></pre></p>

/clearstats <p>Syntax: <code>/clearstats [player]</code> Description: Wipe all allocated and unspent status points to 0. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player]</code> Example: <pre><code>/clearstats [player]
</code></pre></p> /clearwanted <p>Syntax: <code>/clearwanted [player]</code> Description: Pardon player and clear active criminal wanted status. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player]</code> Example: <pre><code>/clearwanted [player]
</code></pre></p> /giveexp <p>Syntax: <code>/giveexp &lt;player&gt; &lt;amount&gt;</code> Description: Give experience points to a player. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;player&gt; &lt;amount&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/giveexp &lt;player&gt; &lt;amount&gt;
</code></pre></p> /givetech <p>Syntax: <code>/givetech &lt;player&gt; &lt;amount&gt; [boss]</code> Description: Give technology points. Add 'boss' for boss tech points. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;player&gt; &lt;amount&gt; [boss]</code> Example: <pre><code>/givetech &lt;player&gt; &lt;amount&gt; [boss]
</code></pre></p> /godmode <p>Syntax: <code>/godmode &lt;player&gt; [on|off]</code> Description: Toggle invincibility for a player. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;player&gt; [on|off]</code> Example: <pre><code>/godmode &lt;player&gt; [on|off]
</code></pre></p> /heal <p>Syntax: <code>/heal [player]</code> Description: Restore a player to full HP. Defaults to self. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player]</code> Example: <pre><code>/heal [player]
</code></pre></p> /knock <p>Syntax: <code>/knock [player]</code> Description: Knock a player into DBNO bleedout state (0 HP). Defaults to self. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player]</code> Example: <pre><code>/knock [player]
</code></pre></p> /lockalltech <p>Syntax: <code>/lockalltech [player]</code> Description: Reset and lock all technology recipes. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player]</code> Example: <pre><code>/lockalltech [player]
</code></pre></p> /lockfasttravel <p>Syntax: <code>/lockfasttravel [player]</code> Description: Lock all Fast Travel statues. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player]</code> Example: <pre><code>/lockfasttravel [player]
</code></pre></p> /maxrelics <p>Syntax: <code>/maxrelics [player]</code> Description: Max out Lifmunk Effigies / capture power. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player]</code> Example: <pre><code>/maxrelics [player]
</code></pre></p> /rename <p>Syntax: <code>/rename [player] &lt;NewNickname&gt;</code> Description: Change player's in-game nickname. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player] &lt;NewNickname&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/rename [player] &lt;NewNickname&gt;
</code></pre></p> /resetalltech <p>Syntax: <code>/resetalltech [player]</code> Description: Reset and lock all technology recipes. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player]</code> Example: <pre><code>/resetalltech [player]
</code></pre></p> /resetlevel <p>Syntax: <code>/resetlevel [player]</code> Description: Reset player to Level 1 and 0 EXP. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player]</code> Example: <pre><code>/resetlevel [player]
</code></pre></p> /resetstats <p>Syntax: <code>/resetstats [player]</code> Description: Reset allocated status points and refund them to unspent points. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player]</code> Example: <pre><code>/resetstats [player]
</code></pre></p> /resetstats <p>Syntax: <code>/resetstats [player]</code> Description: Refund all allocated player stat points back to unallocated status points. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player]</code> Example: <pre><code>/resetstats [player]
</code></pre></p> /respawn <p>Syntax: <code>/respawn [player]</code> Description: Force-respawn a player via CheatManager. Defaults to self. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player]</code> Example: <pre><code>/respawn [player]
</code></pre></p> /respawnboss <p>Syntax: <code>/respawnboss &lt;boss_name|spawner_name|all&gt;</code> Description: Force an immediate respawn of an Alpha boss or spawner. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;boss_name|spawner_name|all&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/respawnboss &lt;boss_name|spawner_name|all&gt;
</code></pre></p> /respec <p>Syntax: <code>/respec [player]</code> Description: Reset allocated status points and refund them to unspent points. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player]</code> Example: <pre><code>/respec [player]
</code></pre></p> /sethp <p>Syntax: <code>/sethp &lt;player&gt; &lt;amount&gt;</code> Description: Set a player's exact HP via CheatManager. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;player&gt; &lt;amount&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/sethp &lt;player&gt; &lt;amount&gt;
</code></pre></p> /setlevel <p>Syntax: <code>/setlevel [player] &lt;1-80|max&gt;</code> Description: Set player level directly (up to 80+). Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player] &lt;1-80|max&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/setlevel [player] &lt;1-80|max&gt;
</code></pre></p> /setmaxweight <p>Syntax: <code>/setmaxweight [player] &lt;weight&gt;</code> Description: Override maximum inventory carrying weight. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player] &lt;weight&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/setmaxweight [player] &lt;weight&gt;
</code></pre></p> /setrelics <p>Syntax: <code>/setrelics [player] &lt;amount&gt;</code> Description: Set Lifmunk Effigies collected for capture power upgrades. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>[player] &lt;amount&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/setrelics [player] &lt;amount&gt;
</code></pre></p> /setsp <p>Syntax: <code>/setsp &lt;player&gt; &lt;amount&gt;</code> Description: Set a player's exact SP (stamina) via CheatManager. Permissions: <code>In-Game Chat</code>, <code>REST API</code>, <code>Admin Only</code> Arguments: <code>&lt;player&gt; &lt;amount&gt;</code> Example: <pre><code>/setsp &lt;player&gt; &lt;amount&gt;
